# Optional: Z-Image Turbo on this PC (images/local/zimage.py). About 3 GB; installed only when the user asks
# (Settings → Images → Local image support), into Aethel's runtime, constrained by core.txt so it never changes a
# core package. The lock, local-images.txt, is generated from this with hashes:
#   frontend_app\src-tauri\payload\uv\uv.exe pip compile backend\requirements\local-images.in --generate-hashes
#       --constraint backend\requirements\core.txt --index-strategy unsafe-best-match --emit-index-url
#       --python-version 3.11 --python-platform x86_64-pc-windows-msvc -o backend\requirements\local-images.txt
# torch 2.7 (not 2.5): 2.5 pins sympy 1.13.1, which conflicts with onnxruntime's in core.txt. The CUDA 12.6 build
# also runs on a CPU.
